  contentsAnswer: A spare battery and a few hand tools. Emergency kit. I like being
    prepared.
  weightAnswer: Roughly eight kilos in the hard case.
  metalAnswer: Some metal in the tools and battery, with plenty of foam.
  packingAnswer: Everything clamped into fitted foam. No liquid containers or moving
    machinery.
  responseAnswer: That must be a loose latch. It should make one little rattle and
    stop.
  authorReasoning: 'Carrier: 7.8 kg and moderate metal fit. Clear delayed movement
    lasting several seconds conflicts with the rigid dry load and single-latch explanation.
    Innocent water case 04 gives a matching explanation instead.'
